  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Pawtucket, RI, Level 7 Tattoo & Piercings stands out as a beacon of artistry and precision, specializing in minimalist, realism, and black & gray tattoo designs. At Level 7, we pride ourselves on a creative atmosphere where Rob, Aaron, and Jake - our talented team of artists and piercers - bring your unique visions to life with a custom approach tailored to each client.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Pawtucket, Rhode Island, United States"
